_2710374385793731_4335129908217143921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x4iZpCQLAWcQ7kNvwFVGcYa&_nc_oc=AdqG1vXZ9JWIiLq653ttMLXiHes2DoUEUNnwxFiaa9plUxt3S0zOrR4hzLEFpJDtiZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCBYj3y6QeV7OP5FDzoFoOQFdUX3iewd41c0tXUE7Bq7w&oe=6A58E25E"}, {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "1819549741885168", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984474_1819549745218501_878499352484891744_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wqb3XOEaJQUQ7kNvwHXFVwg&_nc_oc=AdrsjepcsDJMKZ-vyAv0ggakDAlMEcR5sYY_3wV_jaW439CD6Z42Z7XIcc2nLIFM1dg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA1wNI4SQFOmboO9AwpZTPE57mCqqMvYZFlZyYJm5c9QQ&oe=6A58F06D"}, {"file_name": "002.png", "id": "790364216531353", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974483_790364219864686_8155488325575676486_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eitFdTcCN9UQ7kNvwGtdvCt&_nc_oc=AdrK8uGI6M2N4UZww_3Fltlg2xH_fT_YGN4APx5UAfykt2NV36ZvJA4rV9NdBsFBGW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDCe-ti3jf9uyAE_3Dd9DSSjtyBXlPf-XjCi_msHr_c5Q&oe=6A58D06C"}, {"file_name": "001.png", "id": "1205543714149528", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75269591_1205543717482861_1636873667456873713_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zr29vPQA2AQQ7kNvwGf4h8Q&_nc_oc=Adq09qD8lcIhbp4a26g9nUmWsRe3y20qy5UZv7w0m5h-ye2nOS3_mH-Gus_1l6zNznw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAYiqxVDB_UwlFJz2_3suMH2WMq7CCXcj9lmgD0yUT-Eg&oe=6A58D834"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "476707408073775", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75294244_476707411407108_5418331704720470775_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KhcdA_aAZRkQ7kNvwENcsAi&_nc_oc=Ado5HDrBcc5IX_WWr3fvaDC0hEcy4_vPMAC_GnZT8w-gxNnD5G7R_aJ3p9EfdD3PNeA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAIYblNaxlB3UFKFdHR9jpTKchM_KA3JZmxz6r22uB4Aw&oe=6A58C838"}, "display_name": "Virnect View", "keywords": ["virnect", "view", "ar", "industry", "virnectview"], "long_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency with VIRNECT View.\n\nEasily augment manuals on actual equipment to confirm equipment usage.\n\nCheck real-time field data and operate processes efficiently.\n\nShorten training time for new employees by utilizing realistic educational content.\n\n[Main Features]\n\nSpatial-based AR Content Visualization\nAllows for more accurate problem confirmation than paper manuals\n\nOffline Environment Support\nDownload AR content to your device for easy access even in offline environments.\n\nReal-time Data Monitoring\nConnects data information to content for direct on-site viewing.\n\nWork Result Report Writing\nCreate reports while viewing AR content.\n(Supports text input, photo capture, and checklist-style work reporting)\n\nImmersive Content\nProvides a more immersive content experience through various animations and interaction functions.\n\n[Access Permission Guide]\n\nIf necessary access is not allowed, there may be restrictions on service usage.\n\n[Open Source License Guide]\n\nIn-App Information Notification\n\n[Customer Support Center]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/support/inquiry\n\n[Website]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/\n\nThis is an enterprise app. Please purchase licenses from the payment center (web) to use.", "short_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency by using VIRNECT View.\n\nYou can easily check how to use the equipment by augmenting the manual on the actual equipment.\n\nSee real-time field data and operate the process efficiently.\n\nTraining time for new employees can be shortened by using realistic educational content."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://console.virnect.com/legal?type=policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://console.virnect.com/l